  " i am functioning well, thank you for asking. how can i assist you today?\ni'm here to help with a wide range of topics, from answering questions and providing information to helping manage your schedule or reminders. feel free to ask me anything that's on your mind, and i'll do my best to be helpful!_p225_100": {
