  },
  " you're very welcome! i'm here to help you with any questions or tasks you have. let me know if there's something specific you need assistance with today.\nfor now, how about some interesting trivia? did you know that the first recorded use of the term \"robot\" was in a 1920 czech play called \"r.u.r.\" (rossum's universal robots)? the play is considered one of the seminal works of science fiction and it introduced the concept of artificial beings being mass-produced to replace human labor. intriguing, isn't it? if you have any other requests or questions, feel free to ask!_p225_100": {
